      "text": "Do you remember the movie Her from 2013",
      "word_start": 0,
      "word_end": 8
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0000_1",
      "start": 4.009,
      "end": 9.153,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "? It's about Theodore , an introvert who falls in love with his AI assistant Samantha",
      "word_start": 8,
      "word_end": 22
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0001",
      "start": 10.615,
      "end": 13.537,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Where'd you get that name from? I gave it to myself , actually.",
      "word_start": 22,
      "word_end": 34
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0002",
      "start": 13.917,
      "end": 16.599,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Fast forward 13 years to July 2026.",
      "word_start": 34,
      "word_end": 41
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0003",
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 24.226,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "openai releases gpt live , promising a meaningful upgrade to their ChatGPT voice assistant.",
      "word_start": 41,
      "word_end": 54
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0004",
      "start": 24.95,
      "end": 31.494,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "What do you think? If you go up, it's going to get kind of baggy. Although baggy is very popular now, don't you think?",
      "word_start": 54,
      "word_end": 78
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0005",
      "start": 31.954,
      "end": 35.756,
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "And OpenAI are not the only ones trying to bring Her to life.",
      "word_start": 78,
      "word_end": 91
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "p0006",
      "start": 36.397,
      "end": 40.459,
      "speaker": "",
